{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Velo JSON API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "### What You Can Do with This API\n- Get available shipping services for a customer's address\n- Create orders\n- Confirm delivery orders\n- Generate a pdf shipping label\n- Check an order's status\n\n### *** IMPORTANT - Authentication - Getting Your HMAC ***\nYour HMAC is an encoded string we use to identify you, similar to a password.\nYou'll need your HMAC for all requests.\nSteps to get it:\n1. Find an HMAC generator (there are many free ones online, such as [this one.](https://www.freeformatter.com/hmac-generator.html))\n2. Insert a string made of your email and API key, like this: `youremail@gmail.comYOURAPIKEY`\n3. Use your API secret key as the HMAC secret key\n4. Compute the HMAC\n\n### Intended Flow\n1. **Get shipping options** - send the target address to the API, and all available shipping methods are returned for you to select from.\n2. **Create order** - send your target address with a polygon ID and external service ID.  \n  If the external service ID from step 1 is `null`, you can pass `null` here. This creates an order in the Velo system with status `\"placed\"`.\n3. **Review** - verify that all the order's details are correct on the Velo panel or via the /info/{order} endpoint.\n4. **Confirm delivery** - once packed and ready, confirm delivery. We'll transmit it to the delivery company, and you'll get a barcode.  \n  Every order MUST have a label with the barcode clearly on the packaging.  \n  You can get a label from the Velo panel or use your own (just don't forget the barcode).\n5. **Optional - Generate a shipping label** - You can use the /label/{order} endpoint to create a pdf shipping label for your package. You can also generate the label via the Velo panel.\n6. **Get order info** - track in the Velo panel or via the API. Other data such as available tracking links and label pdf link will be included in the response (see the DeliveryInfoResponse schema for more information).\n\n[Velo \u2764](https://veloapp.io)\n",
    "x-jentic-source-url": "https://api.swaggerhub.com/apis/ItayRijensky/Velo_JSON_API/1.0.0"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "description": "Operations related to managing orders."
    }
  ],
  "servers": [
    {
      "description": "Velo Production Server",
      "url": "https://api.veloapp.io"
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "parameters": {
      "ContentType": {
        "name": "Content-Type",
        "in": "header",
        "required": false,
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "application/json"
        }
      },
      "XVeloApiKey": {
        "name": "X-Velo-Api-Key",
        "in": "header",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Your Api Key from the Velo App Center",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "XVeloHmac": {
        "name": "X-Velo-Hmac",
        "in": "header",
        "required": true,
        "description": "A sha256 string encoded with your secret key, composed of your Velo email, followed by your api key (e.g. youremail@gmail.comYOURAPIKEY). Your api key and secret key are available at the Velo App Center.\n",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "examples": {
          "defaultExample": {
            "value": "7c6e4627118..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "CheckRequestBody": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "weight",
          "dimensions",
          "customerAddress"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "customerAddress": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Address",
            "description": "The customer's delivery address",
            "examples": [
              {
                "street": "Main St",
                "number": "123",
                "city": "Exampleville",
                "zip": "12345",
                "country": "Countryland",
                "phone": "5555555"
              }
            ]
          },
          "storeAddress": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Address",
            "description": "The store's delivery address - if not sent, this defaults to the closest pickup address to the customer your store has on Velo",
            "examples": [
              {
                "street": "Store Ave",
                "number": "456",
                "city": "Shop City",
                "zip": "67890",
                "country": "Retailand",
                "phone": "0000000"
              }
            ]
          },
          "weight": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "The package's weight",
            "examples": [
              0
            ]
          },
          "deliveryType": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Delivery type",
            "enum": [
              "normal",
              "return",
              "replacement"
            ],
            "default": "normal"
          },
          "dimensions": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "The package's size measurements",
            "properties": {
              "width": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "height": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "depth": {
                "type": "number"
              }
            },
            "examples": [
              {
                "width": 0,
                "height": 0,
                "depth": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "packagesCount": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "How many packages are sent in this delivery (defaults to 1)",
            "examples": [
              1
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "OrderRequestBody": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "customerAddress"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "customerAddress": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Address",
            "description": "The customer's delivery address",
            "examples": [
              {
                "street": "Main St",
                "number": "123",
                "city": "Exampleville",
                "zip": "12345",
                "country": "Countryland",
                "phone": "5555555"
              }
            ]
          },
          "storeAddress": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Address",
            "description": "The store's delivery address - if not sent, this defaults to the pickup address that has the best service for the customer",
